WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.471
smiled at Wukong.

2
00:00:13.491 --> 00:00:16.193
"How did you get so powerful?"

3
00:00:17.974 --> 00:00:20.616
"A sage taught me secret formulas," said Wukong.

4
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.621
practiced them for many years.

5
00:00:27.882 --> 00:00:31.100
I am now equal to the Jade Emperor."

6
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:36.583
"The Jade Emperor has been practicing the same formulas for many lifetimes," said Buddha.

7
00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:39.985
"How can you think you're equal to him?

8
00:00:41.126 --> 00:00:44.408
Go back to your mountain now and behave yourself."

9
00:00:46.849 --> 00:00:47.610
said Wukong.

10
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:50.311
"I'm not leaving until I get to rule Heaven."

11
00:00:52.233 --> 00:00:53.173
thought for a minute.

12
00:00:54.514 --> 00:00:59.832
"Sun Wukong, what powers do you have?"

13
00:00:59.912 --> 00:01:02.333
"I can change into other animals," said Wukong.

14
00:01:03.314 --> 00:01:04.875
can soar through the sky on clouds.

15
00:01:05.915 --> 00:01:06.896
I can do anything I want!"

16
00:01:09.517 --> 00:01:11.358
let's make a bet," said Buddha.

17
00:01:11.378 --> 00:01:14.360
"If you win, you can rule Heaven.

18
00:01:16.521 --> 00:01:20.383
The Jade Emperor will come to live with me in the Western Paradise.

19
00:01:21.744 --> 00:01:24.906
But if you lose, you will be punished severely."

20
00:01:24.926 --> 00:01:27.507
"What do I have to do?"

21
00:01:27.867 --> 00:01:28.688
asked Wukong.

22
00:01:30.408 --> 00:01:31.889
simple," said Buddha.

23
00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:34.390
He held out his hand.

24
00:01:35.731 --> 00:01:38.072
"You just have to jump off my hand."

25
00:01:41.314 --> 00:01:44.156
laughed. "That's easy!

26
00:01:44.776 --> 00:01:46.517
I can jump across entire oceans!"

27
00:01:48.098 --> 00:01:49.078
Buddha smiled.

28
00:01:49.098 --> 00:01:51.720
"Well then, let's see you do it."

29
00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:00.542
Wukong stepped up onto Buddha's palm.

30
00:02:00.562 --> 00:02:04.506
"You're a fool," he said to Buddha.

31
00:02:05.607 --> 00:02:08.069
"I'm going to jump farther than you could ever imagine.

32
00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:11.612
When I return, I'll be the ruler of Heaven!"

33
00:02:12.813 --> 00:02:15.275
Wukong leaped and soared through the air.

34
00:02:19.679 --> 00:02:23.282
After a long time, he saw five enormous pillars.

35
00:02:24.603 --> 00:02:25.824
He landed in front of them.

36
00:02:27.468 --> 00:02:30.030
"This must be the end of the world," he said to himself.

37
00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:34.313
"I'll go back now and tell Buddha to take the Jade Emperor away.

38
00:02:35.574 --> 00:02:36.655
Heaven is mine!"

39
00:02:38.236 --> 00:02:41.739
Wukong was just about to jump back when he thought of something.

40
00:02:41.759 --> 00:02:44.941
"There's nobody around," he thought.

41
00:02:46.382 --> 00:02:47.803
will I prove that I was here?"

42
00:02:48.404 --> 00:02:49.404
He tapped his chin.

43
00:02:51.226 --> 00:02:52.467
write a note on this pillar.

44
00:02:52.947 --> 00:02:55.448
Buddha can come here and check."

45
00:02:55.528 --> 00:03:00.189
Wukong plucked two hairs and turned them into a brush and a jar of ink.

46
00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:08.972
On one of the pillars, he wrote: Wukong was here.

47
00:03:10.892 --> 00:03:11.572
said Wukong.

48
00:03:11.592 --> 00:03:14.193
"Now I'll go and tell Buddha how far I jumped."

49
00:03:15.874 --> 00:03:17.434
Wukong leaped once more.

50
00:03:21.655 --> 00:03:24.416
After a long time, he landed on Buddha's palm again.

51
00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:26.521
"I'm back!"

52
00:03:26.761 --> 00:03:27.542
said Wukong.

53
00:03:27.562 --> 00:03:30.244
"Tell the Jade Emperor to leave."

54
00:03:31.605 --> 00:03:34.887
frowned. "How can you say you're back?

55
00:03:35.628 --> 00:03:37.189
You never left my hand."

56
00:03:40.251 --> 00:03:41.132
was confused.

57
00:03:41.152 --> 00:03:43.774
"Yes, I did!

58
00:03:44.354 --> 00:03:45.435
I reached the end of the world.

59
00:03:47.156 --> 00:03:48.517
were five enormous pillars.

60
00:03:48.918 --> 00:03:49.798
I even wrote on one.

61
00:03:50.659 --> 00:03:51.620
Come with me and I'll show you."

62
00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:55.702
no need to go anywhere," said Buddha.

63
00:03:55.722 --> 00:03:57.963
"Just look down."

64
00:03:59.924 --> 00:04:01.125
Wukong looked down.

65
00:04:04.246 --> 00:04:09.589
Near the bottom of Buddha's middle finger was the note: Wukong was here.

66
00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:12.030
stomped his foot.

67
00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:14.172
"It's a trick!

68
00:04:14.612 --> 00:04:16.033
You used some sort of magic!"

69
00:04:17.934 --> 00:04:19.554
not a trick," said Buddha.

70
00:04:20.455 --> 00:04:23.929
"You never left my palm."

71
00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:27.391
did! I did!"

72
00:04:27.672 --> 00:04:28.452
cried Wukong.

73
00:04:28.472 --> 00:04:34.337
"I jumped all the way lost the bet, Sun Wukong," said Buddha.

74
00:04:34.357 --> 00:04:37.399
"And now you will be punished."

75
00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:43.343
Holding Wukong tightly, Buddha reached down to Earth.

76
00:04:44.684 --> 00:04:49.128
His hand turned into a mountain, which he placed on top of the monkey.

77
00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:54.723
"Grr!" Wukong grunted, and pushed with all his strength.

78
00:04:55.843 --> 00:04:57.444
The mountain started to rise.

79
00:04:58.745 --> 00:05:02.247
Buddha pulled a small sheet of magic paper from his sleeve.

80
00:05:03.948 --> 00:05:05.749
laid the paper on top of the mountain.

81
00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:09.311
The mountain dropped back down.

82
00:05:10.512 --> 00:05:12.393
Buddha turned to the Jade Emperor.

83
00:05:12.413 --> 00:05:17.056
"Sun Wukong can't lift the mountain now," he said.

84
00:05:20.109 --> 00:05:22.882
"He will be trapped until his punishment is over."
